<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Application Update</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f6f9;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f6f9;padding:40px 0;">
<tr>
<td align="center">

<table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;">

    <!-- Header -->
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="background:#dc2626;padding:30px;">
            <h1 style="margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:28px;">
                HealthCare
            </h1>
        </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- Body -->
    <tr>
        <td style="padding:40px;">

            <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:#222;">
                Application Update
            </h2>

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                Dear <strong>Dr. <%= name %></strong>,
            </p>

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                Thank you for your interest in joining the HealthCare provider network. Our administration team has carefully reviewed your application and the submitted medical credentials.
            </p>

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                Regrettably, we are unable to approve your provider profile at this time due to the following reason:
            </p>

            <!-- Robust Cross-Client Rejection Badge & Reason -->
            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:30px 0;">
                <tr>
                    <td align="center">
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#fef2f2; border:1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius:8px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding:20px; color:#b91c1c; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; text-align:left;">
                                    <strong style="font-size:16px; display:block; margin-bottom:6px;">✕ Reason for Disapproval:</strong>
                                    <%= rejectionReason %>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                If this issue can be resolved by submitting updated documentation, correcting profile errors, or uploading valid certifications, you are welcome to log into your portal and update your application fields for secondary review.
            </p>

            <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;margin:30px 0;">

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                If you believe this decision was made in error or if you have any questions regarding the credentialing criteria, please contact our provider support desk.
            </p>

            <p style="color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
                Sincerely,<br>
                <strong>The HealthCare Credentialing Team</strong>
            </p>

        </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="background:#f9fafb;padding:25px;">

            <p style="margin:0;color:#777;font-size:14px;">
                © <%= year %> HealthCare. All rights reserved.
            </p>

            <p style="margin-top:8px;color:#999;font-size:12px;">
                This is an automated notification regarding your provider account. Please do not reply directly to this message.
            </p>

        </td>
    </tr>

</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
